    <strong>Type:</strong> Recreational (21+)</p>
    <p>Just Baked is a recognizable central-Maine brand that leans into baked-goods-style edibles alongside a full flower, vape, and concentrate menu. The West Broadway storefront serves adult-use customers 21 and older. <a href="https://www.justbakedmaine.com" rel="noopener noreferrer">justbakedmaine.com</a></p>

