    <p>Blazin' Trailz sits on River Road and is an easy stop for travelers passing through Lincoln on the I-95 / ME-6 corridor. The store carries a broad adult-use menu with a focus on flower and concentrates. <a href="http://www.blazintrailz.com" rel="noopener noreferrer">blazintrailz.com</a></p>

